        "text": "|iteratedDerivWithin n (exteriorProfile C h) (Ici 0) y| ≤ exteriorDerivativeBound C h n for y ≥ 0; with amplitude_formula (K = r^{-1-2h} H_ext(τ/r²)) the chain rule ∂_τ^j K = r^{-1-2h-2j} H_ext^{(j)}(τ/r²) gives the paper's first majorant in a few lines, but that composition is not itself stated"
